# ============================================================
# EPE HYBRID MODEL COMPARISON
# BANK MARKETING DATASET
# ============================================================
#
# This program:
# 1. Loads the validation probabilities generated by
#    epe_hybrid_model.py
#
# 2. Evaluates multiple hybrid combinations
#
# 3. Uses equal-weight probability averaging initially
#
# 4. Calculates:
#       Accuracy
#       Precision
#       Recall
#       F1-Score
#       ROC-AUC
#
# 5. Calculates prediction diversity using:
#       Average pairwise disagreement
#
# 6. Compares all hybrid combinations
#
# 7. Selects the best hybrid based on validation F1
#    and ROC-AUC
#
# IMPORTANT:
# This is an experimental comparison stage.
# We are NOT claiming any hybrid is novel yet.
# ============================================================


